L["The boss's name as you first come within about 28 yards of it, before the fight. A dungeon or raid boss is told by its level: a skull, or on retail two over yours."] = "El nombre del jefe la primera vez que te acercas a unos 28 metros, antes del combate. Un jefe de mazmorra o banda se reconoce por su nivel: una calavera, o en retail dos por encima del tuyo."
